      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">From the village core out to the farm properties along Route 106 and Route 112, we replace and remove heating oil tanks across Salisbury. Free written estimates, and a 24/7 line if your tank is leaking.</p>
