    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Salisbury</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Salisbury Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We swap aging tanks at Salisbury homes and farms for new tanks built to handle outdoor exposure, and most jobs are done in a single day so you're not left without heat.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Switched off oil or have a dead tank sitting in the yard? We pump out the remaining fuel, disconnect the lines, and haul the tank away, leaving the site tidy.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Buried Oil Tank Removal</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Older farm properties around Salisbury sometimes hide an underground tank from decades back. We locate it, dig it out, and give you the paperwork your insurer or lawyer wants to see.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">24/7 Emergency Leak Response</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A leaking oil tank can't wait for Monday, especially mid-winter in Salisbury. Call (506) 802-3471 any hour and we'll walk you through what to do while we're on the way.</p>
      </div>
</div>
